# This file keeps the directory in git until the library is built
# To build the linux-arm64-gnu library:
# 1. Install rustup: curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -sSf https://sh.rustup.rs | sh
# 2. Add target: rustup target add aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu
# 3. Install cross-compilation toolchain (varies by host OS)
# 4. Run: cargo build --release --target aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu
# 5. Copy: cp target/aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu/release/libprotect_ffi.a platforms/linux-arm64-gnu/
